per week, children age \u2265 2 years old with advanced cancer or their parent completed the computer-based Pediatric   
Quality of Life and Evaluation of Symptoms Technology (PediQUEST) survey consisting of age- and respondent-adapted      
versions of the Memorial Symptom Assessment Scale (MSAS), Pediatric Quality of Life Inventory 4.0 Generic Core Scales   
