- Study 144: RCT on COOP Charts health status assessment in HMO                                                         
- Study 145: RCT on mHealth feedback to caregivers in heart failure                                                     
- Study 147: RCT on PROMs monitoring for depression in primary care                                                     
- Study 148: RCT on mental health assessment feedback in behavioral healthcare                                          
- Study 149: Cluster RCT on DIALOG intervention in mental healthcare                                                    
- Study 151: RCT on GHQ screening feedback in primary care                                                              
- Study 152: RCT on patient/therapist feedback in psychotherapy                                                         
- Study 153: RCT on depression self-rating scale in primary care                                                        
- Study 155: RCT on physical function assessment feedback in older adults                                               
- Study 160: RCT on eSAID questionnaire in paediatric dentistry                                                         
- Study 161: RCT on psychological well-being monitoring in diabetes                                                     
                                                                                                                        
**EXCLUDED STUDIES (12):**                                                                                              
- Study 134: RCT comparing Nintendo Wii vs conventional physical therapy (not PROMs feedback)                           
- Study 136: Validation study of COOP Charts (not an RCT comparing feedback)                                            
- Study 139: Systematic review (not a primary RCT)                                                                      
- Study 141: Opinion/policy paper (not an RCT)                                                                          
- Study 146: RCT on stellate ganglion block vs sham (not PROMs feedback)                                                
- Study 150: Observational study (not an RCT)                                                                           
- Study 154: Systematic review (not a primary RCT)                                                                      
- Study 156: Review paper (not an RCT)                                                                                  
- Study 157: Qualitative study (not an RCT)                                                                             
- Study 158: Study protocol only (no results)                                                                           
- Study 159: Bibliographic study (not an RCT)                                                                           
- Study 162: Opinion/educational paper (not an RCT)                                                                     
                                                                                                                        
### 3. Additional context:                                                                                              
The screening was conservative - when in doubt, studies were included for further review. All decisions were based on   
careful reading of titles and abstracts, considering: (1) study design (must be RCT), (2) intervention (must involve    
PROMs feedback), and (3) comparison (must compare feedback vs no feedback). Studies were excluded primarily for: wrong  
